json-editor.js and json-editor.css are the package's unminified dist files.
JavaScript line endings and trailing whitespace are normalized for repository checks.
img/jsoneditor-icons.svg comes from dist/img. The dark theme follows
examples/css/darktheme.css, retaining the local license header and formatting.

DRN customization: json-editor.js captures document.currentScript.nonce when the
classic script loads and applies it to Ace and vanilla-picker style elements
before insertion. Preserve all three changes when replacing the vendor bundle.
The loading script must carry the request nonce under DRN's default CSP.

DRN customization: Ace text_completer's splitRegex uses \w instead of duplicate
ASCII letter, digit and underscore ranges. Preserve the equivalent character
set, including the Unicode ranges, dollar and hyphen, when replacing the bundle.
